  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Worn by the Silvan Prince of Mirkwood, this mantle blends seamlessly into the deepest thickets. It grants a master's command over the wild, allowing the one who carries it to move as a ghost among the trees and command the very spirits of the wood."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Deep forest-green fabric drapes with a fluid grace, muffling the sound of footsteps against the undergrowth. It carries the faint scent of pine needles and holds a cool, lingering dampness even in the heat of the day."
    }
  },
